@startuml
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Shop Owner" as User
participant "Frontend (Admin Panel)" as FE
participant "Backend API" as BE
database "Database" as DB
participant "Green-API" as WhatsAppAPI
participant "Telegram API" as TGAPI

== Screen 1: Account Registration (ACCOUNT_CREATED) ==

User -> FE: Enter data (Name, Email, Phone, Password)
User -> FE: Click "Create Account"
FE -> BE: POST /api/v1/auth/register\n(Name, Email, Phone, Password)
activate BE

BE -> DB: Check Email and create record in User\n(registration_step = 'ACCOUNT_CREATED')
activate DB
DB --> BE: User created
deactivate DB

BE --> FE: Return JWT Token
deactivate BE

FE -> FE: Save token to localStorage
FE -> FE: Redirect to Screen 2

== Screen 2: Shop Profile Creation (SHOP_CREATED) ==

User -> FE: Enter shop data (Name, Address, Hours, Delivery)
User -> FE: Click "Save and Continue"
FE -> BE: POST /api/v1/shops\nBearer Token + (Name, Address, Hours, Delivery)
activate BE

BE -> DB: Create Shop entity (linked to User)
activate DB
DB --> BE: Shop created
deactivate DB

BE -> DB: Update User (registration_step = 'SHOP_CREATED')
activate DB
DB --> BE: Success
deactivate DB

BE --> FE: HTTP 201 Created / Success
deactivate BE

FE -> FE: Redirect to Screen 3

== Screen 3: Communication Channels Connection (CHANNELS_CONFIGURED) ==

alt Case A: Connect WhatsApp via Green-API
    User -> FE: Click "Connect WhatsApp"
    FE -> BE: Request WhatsApp session initialization
    BE -> WhatsAppAPI: Request QR Code
    WhatsAppAPI --> BE: QR Code / Link
    BE --> FE: Display QR Code + Spinner

    User -> WhatsAppAPI: Scan QR Code with phone
    WhatsAppAPI -> BE: Webhook: Session authorized
    activate BE
    BE -> DB: Create WhatsAppConfig
    BE --> FE: [WebSocket/Polling] Status: Connected
    deactivate BE
    FE -> FE: UI: Green checkmark "Active +994..."
end

alt Case B: Connect Telegram Bot
    User -> FE: Enter Telegram Bot Token and click "Activate Token"
    FE -> BE: POST /api/v1/channels/telegram (Token)
    activate BE

    BE -> TGAPI: GET /getMe (Token validation)
    TGAPI --> BE: Response (Bot name, validity)

    alt Token is valid
        BE -> DB: Create TelegramConfig
        BE --> FE: HTTP 200 OK (Bot data)
        FE -> FE: UI: Green checkmark "Active @bot_name"
    else Token is invalid
        BE --> FE: HTTP 400 Bad Request (Token error)
        FE -> FE: Display error to user
    end
    deactivate BE
end

alt Channel Setup Completion
    note over FE: Button is active if\nat least 1 channel is connected
    User -> FE: Click "Complete Setup"
    FE -> BE: PATCH /api/v1/users/status (registration_step = 'COMPLETED')
    activate BE
    BE -> DB: Update status to COMPLETED
    BE --> FE: HTTP 200 OK
    deactivate BE

    FE -> FE: Redirect to Screen 4 (Main Dashboard)
end

== Screen 4: Main Dashboard (COMPLETED) ==

note over FE, DB
  User gets full access to the admin panel:
  - "Products" tab (Catalog filling for AI)
  - "Orders" tab (Viewing customer requests)
  - "Integration Settings" tab (Channel management)
end note

@enduml
